<section name="Maven snapshot repositories">
<p>There are the following Apache Maven repositories that provide binaries
for not-yet-released versions of Apache Tomcat</p>

<ul>
  <li><a href="https://repository.apache.org/content/repositories/snapshots/" rel="nofollow"
    >Snapshots</a> repository.<br />
    These binaries are updated with that each CI build done at ASF Buildbot.<br />
    Browse: <a href="https://repository.apache.org/content/repositories/snapshots/org/apache/tomcat/tomcat/"
    >arg.apache.tomcat : tomcat</a>.
  </li>
  <li><a href="https://repository.apache.org/content/groups/staging/" rel="nofollow"
    >Staging</a> repository.<br />
    It hosts release candidates. Binaries are uploaded here when a release vote is being called.<br />
    Browse: <a href="https://repository.apache.org/content/groups/staging/org/apache/tomcat/tomcat/"
    >arg.apache.tomcat : tomcat</a>.
  </li>
</ul>

</section>

